  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836354",
      "title": "Adding a Modal Component",
      "sourceHash": "0b7b7f433ab46f34ca87c6e7f10a34b2075e6623699f29d6fb9d65f9c13d271f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.02,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "So now that we can finally manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 5.73,
          "en": "those timers and start and stop them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.73,
          "end": 10.17,
          "en": "I also wanna change what happens when the timer expires,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.17,
          "end": 13.473,
          "en": "or if we successfully stop it in time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.43,
          "end": 18.51,
          "en": "Because in both cases, I wanna show a pop-up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.51,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "that lets us know about our result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 23.463,
          "en": "and about the score we achieved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.57,
          "end": 28.5,
          "en": "Because the closer we are to the timer expiring,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 30.873,
          "en": "the higher the score should be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.74,
          "end": 35.163,
          "en": "Unless it did expire, in which we lost, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.36,
          "end": 38.4,
          "en": "So I wanna show such a pop-up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.4,
          "end": 40.59,
          "en": "and I'll therefore add a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.59,
          "end": 42.153,
          "en": "which I'll name ResultModal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.34,
          "end": 48.189,
          "en": "A modal is basically just a dialog that's opened up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.189,
          "end": 51.423,
          "en": "on top of the screen, visually, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.8,
          "end": 55.41,
          "en": "So therefor right here, we export a component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.41,
          "end": 56.523,
          "en": "called ResultModal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 63.34,
          "en": "And here I now wanna return the built-in dialog element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 68.25,
          "en": "which comes with built-in styling and some built-in features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.25,
          "end": 70.98,
          "en": "that make presenting it as an overlay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.98,
          "end": 72.423,
          "en": "pretty easy and convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.41,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "And in that element, I'll add a h2 tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 79.65299999999999,
          "en": "where I either wanna say you lost,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 83.10300000000001,
          "en": "or your score.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.57,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "Now at the moment we won't have any score",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 91.02,
          "en": "because we just have a timer that expires or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.02,
          "end": 92.493,
          "en": "but we'll soon change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 95.78999999999999,
          "en": "So for the moment I'll just say you lost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.78999999999999,
          "end": 97.053,
          "en": "or you won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.46000000000001,
          "end": 100.65,
          "en": "And therefor, of course, we'll need a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.65,
          "end": 102.693,
          "en": "the result essentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.28,
          "end": 107.72999999999999,
          "en": "And maybe also the target time we had,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.72999999999999,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "so that we also can show some information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 111.90299999999999,
          "en": "about that here in this dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 117.6,
          "en": "And then here we could output, you result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 121.26,
          "en": "and result is either won or lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 122.79,
          "en": "Again, that will change later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.79,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "but for now we'll output this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "and then below that in a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 131.25,
          "en": "I would put, the target time was,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 133.203,
          "en": "and then in a strong element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 136.11,
          "en": "target time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 137.55,
          "en": "seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 138.383,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 143.85,
          "en": "And later we'll say, you stopped the timer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.85,
          "end": 146.673,
          "en": "with 'x' seconds left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.93,
          "end": 150.69,
          "en": "And that will also go into a strong element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.69,
          "end": 152.73,
          "en": "but it is something we'll add later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.73,
          "end": 154.23,
          "en": "once we changed the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.23,
          "end": 156.873,
          "en": "so that we know how much time was left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.07,
          "end": 160.41,
          "en": "And then below that I'll add a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.41,
          "end": 162.85,
          "en": "where I set the method to dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.07,
          "end": 165.87,
          "en": "which is something that's built into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.87,
          "end": 169.86,
          "en": "native HTML and supported by modern browsers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.86,
          "end": 174.03,
          "en": "So not React specific because if you add a form like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.03,
          "end": 176.22,
          "en": "with the method set to dialog,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.22,
          "end": 180.54,
          "en": "inside of a dialogue, a button that submits the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.54,
          "end": 181.89,
          "en": "like this close button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.89,
          "end": 183.99,
          "en": "will close this dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.99,
          "end": 188.043,
          "en": "without any extra JavaScript or anything like that required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.23,
          "end": 192.96,
          "en": "So that's now my dialog modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.96,
          "end": 196.86,
          "en": "and I'll give it a class name of ResultModal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.86,
          "end": 198.543,
          "en": "for styling purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.85,
          "end": 203.91,
          "en": "And now the goal is to show that dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.91,
          "end": 208.44,
          "en": "from inside the timer challenge, once the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.44,
          "end": 212.01,
          "en": "And therefore I'll start with the scenario that we lost,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.01,
          "end": 214.203,
          "en": "so that the timer expired.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.57999999999998,
          "end": 217.8,
          "en": "In that case, I wanna show this modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.8,
          "end": 220.11,
          "en": "and therefore here in the JSX code return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.11,
          "end": 221.76,
          "en": "by timer challenge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.76,
          "end": 224.73,
          "en": "we can wrap this into a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.73,
          "end": 228.21,
          "en": "so that side by side with this section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.21,
          "end": 230.503,
          "en": "we can output our ResultModal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.29,
          "end": 235.65,
          "en": "And for that, of course, ResultModal must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 235.65,
          "end": 238.563,
          "en": "from the ResultModal doc JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 240.78,
          "end": 243.96,
          "en": "And with that imported, we can output it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.96,
          "end": 247.05,
          "en": "but it should of course be output conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.05,
          "end": 249.93,
          "en": "If the timer expired, if that is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.93,
          "end": 252.45,
          "en": "I wanna render ResultModal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.45,
          "end": 255.93,
          "en": "and I'll set the target time equal to my target time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.93,
          "end": 257.883,
          "en": "which I have here in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 258.9,
          "end": 261.69,
          "en": "So the value I get on this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261.69,
          "end": 263.65,
          "en": "I'll forward this to ResultModal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.92,
          "end": 270.543,
          "en": "and I'll set the result to lost, in this case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 274.83,
          "en": "And we can now get rid of this conditional paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.83,
          "end": 276.423,
          "en": "since we now have the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.77,
          "end": 279.78,
          "en": "But you'll notice that if you do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.78,
          "end": 282.63,
          "en": "and you start the challenge and you don't stop it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.63,
          "end": 285,
          "en": "nothing seems to happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 285,
          "end": 287.013,
          "en": "Even though we lost here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.81,
          "end": 290.15999999999997,
          "en": "And the reason for that is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.15999999999997,
          "end": 292.74,
          "en": "that this built-in dialog element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.74,
          "end": 294.843,
          "en": "by default is invisible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.71,
          "end": 300.18,
          "en": "But it can be made visible by adding the open prop to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.18,
          "end": 301.983,
          "en": "So this open attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.08,
          "end": 308.67,
          "en": "So if I do this here, and I start and don't stop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 308.67,
          "end": 311.19,
          "en": "indeed I get this dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 311.19,
          "end": 313.263,
          "en": "And I can close it by clicking close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 314.37,
          "end": 319.2,
          "en": "But as you might notice, this dialog is a bit hard to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 319.2,
          "end": 324.2,
          "en": "because the background isn't dimmed as this dialog opens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 327.363,
          "en": "And it would be nice if that would happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 329.13,
          "end": 332.52,
          "en": "Now we could manually add another element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 332.52,
          "end": 334.05,
          "en": "in our ResultModal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.05,
          "end": 336.87,
          "en": "that is displayed behind that dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 336.87,
          "end": 340.8,
          "en": "and that is basically used to dim the background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 340.8,
          "end": 342.18,
          "en": "behind the dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 342.18,
          "end": 344.79,
          "en": "That is something we could do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 344.79,
          "end": 348.27,
          "en": "But this dialog element actually comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 348.27,
          "end": 352.32,
          "en": "with a built-in backdrop element that will be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 352.32,
          "end": 354.12,
          "en": "behind the dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 354.12,
          "end": 356.85,
          "en": "but unfortunately this built-in backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.85,
          "end": 361.44,
          "en": "will not be shown if you force the dialog to be visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 361.44,
          "end": 364.113,
          "en": "by setting open to true like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 365.7,
          "end": 370.53,
          "en": "Instead we have to open this dialog programmatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 370.53,
          "end": 374.13,
          "en": "by sending a command to the browser, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 374.13,
          "end": 376.323,
          "en": "to get this built-in backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 377.34,
          "end": 380.61,
          "en": "And that's again an example for a scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 380.61,
          "end": 383.1,
          "en": "where refs can help us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 383.1,
          "end": 386.46,
          "en": "Now we'll just have to make sure that we can access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 386.46,
          "end": 389.31,
          "en": "this dialog in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 389.31,
          "end": 391.86,
          "en": "from inside the timer challenge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 391.86,
          "end": 394.77,
          "en": "Because it's there where we in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.77,
          "end": 398.163,
          "en": "want to open that dialog once the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}